---
// Wordmark: a volt "starter tag" plus the name, bold "fitness", light "complete".
---
<span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 group">
  <span class="relative size-8 rounded-[9px] bg-volt text-ink grid place-items-center font-display font-extrabold text-[15px] tracking-tighter transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:-rotate-6">
    fc
    <span class="absolute -top-1 -right-1 size-2.5 rounded-full bg-current ring-2 ring-volt"></span>
  </span>
  <span class="font-display text-[1.28rem] tracking-[-0.04em] leading-none">
    <span class="font-extrabold">fitness</span><span class="font-light">complete</span>
  </span>
</span>
